Cell["\<\
Once the equations of motion are saved to a file \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]eqlistmat\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], the follwing is the \
code to run. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.741343907827383*^9, 
  3.7413439645961637`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"90e37e51-988a-4ad6-aa54-\
