Cell["\<\
epValue: When the change for an iteration is smaller than the epValue, the \
iteration will stop\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.741344543585189*^9, 3.74134459728094*^9}, {
  3.741344640303876*^9, 
  3.741344750768185*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dc74d07d-27aa-4a16-86e3-\
80df70c29b3b"],

Cell["\<\
eqlistmatQ: If the equations and there Jacobian are saved to an optimized \
file, this option must be set to be True.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.741344543585189*^9, 3.74134459728094*^9}, {
  3.741344640303876*^9, 
  3.741344795870843*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e9ab49bb-d2ee-4c0d-9aea-\
f39c0640feb8"],

Cell["\<\
iniQ: If this is True, then the initial guess of the solution calcfref. If it \
is False, then not run calcfref.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.741344543585189*^9, 3.74134459728094*^9}, {
  3.741344640303876*^9, 
  3.7413448760249577`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b7964e7d-f8c5-48fc-8553-\
5cfbf2085691"],

Cell["\<\
linearQ: If the equations are linear, this must be set to be True.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.741344543585189*^9, 3.74134459728094*^9}, {
  3.741344640303876*^9, 
  3.741344906630303*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0288cf8a-365e-451f-8365-\
aa98a4588ea1"],

Cell["\<\
lsqrQ: If this is True, then use LeastSquare instead of LinearSolve\
\>", "Item",
